libhmac
------------------------------------------
libhmac is a library to support various Hash-based Message Authentication Codes
(HMAC).

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcerror1-20260703-1bl1
  libcfile1-20260704-1bl1
  libclocale1-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify1-20260703-1bl1
  libcsplit1-20260703-1bl1
  libhmac-devel-20260522-1bl1
  libhmac1-20260522-1bl1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1
  python312-3.12.12-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20260320-2
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gettext-devel-0.22.5-1
  libcerror-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcfile-devel-20260704-1bl1
  libclocale-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcnotify-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcpath-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcsplit-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libcthreads-devel-20260703-1bl1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libuna-devel-20260602-1bl2
  make-4.4.1-2
  python3-3.12.12-1
  python3-devel-3.12.12-1
  zlib-devel-1.4-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/libyal/libhmac

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/libyal/libhmac/archive/refs/tags/20260522.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libhmac-20260522-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libhmac-20260522-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libhmac-20260522-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhmac-20260522-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhmac1-20260522-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libhmac-devel-20260522-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/python312-libhmac-20260522-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libhmac)
  /usr/bin/hmacsum.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libhmac.README
  /usr/share/doc/libhmac/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libhmac/COPYING
  /usr/share/doc/libhmac/COPYING.LESSER
  /usr/share/doc/libhmac/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libhmac/README
  /usr/share/man/man1/hmacsum.1.gz

(libhmac1)
  /usr/bin/cyghmac-1.dll

(libhmac-devel)
  /usr/include/libhmac.h
  /usr/include/libhmac/definitions.h
  /usr/include/libhmac/error.h
  /usr/include/libhmac/extern.h
  /usr/include/libhmac/features.h
  /usr/include/libhmac/types.h
  /usr/lib/libhmac.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libhmac.pc
  /usr/share/man/man3/libhmac.3.gz

(python312-libhmac)
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyhmac.cpython-312-x86_64-cygwin.dll
  /usr/lib/python3.12/site-packages/pyhmac.dll

